{"number":108,"nameArabic":"الكوثر","nameSimple":"Al-Kawthar","nameEnglish":"The Abundance","revelationPlace":"makkah","ayahCount":3,"bismillahPre":true,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"ar":"إِنّا أَعطَينٰكَ الكَوثَرَ","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَعْطَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَوْثَرَ <span class=end>١</span>","en":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar."},{"n":2,"ar":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَانحَر","tj":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>نْحَرْ <span class=end>٢</span>","en":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone]."},{"n":3,"ar":"إِنَّ شانِئَكَ هُوَ الأَبتَرُ","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تَرُ <span class=end>٣</span>","en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off."}]}